Another fan, meanwhile, warned that the movie will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:18.000
terrify even the most hardened and&nbsp;
experienced horror fans, writing,

00:01:28.687 --> 00:01:33.840
Elsewhere, another moviegoer thanked "literal&nbsp;
